description:
Create `dashboard/frontend/components/landing/EditorialGrid.tsx`.

A layout-only component that arranges children in the T-shape CSS grid.

Props: `{ definePanel: ReactNode, judgePanel: ReactNode, executePanel: ReactNode, learnPanel: ReactNode }`

CSS Grid:
```css
.editorial-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr 320px;
  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 24px;
  height: 100%;
}
```

Grid placement:
- Define: `grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3;` (left, full height)
- Judge: `grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1;` (top center)
- Execute: `grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2;` (bottom center)
- Learn: `grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1 / 3;` (right, full height)

Use CSS modules or inline styles (follow project convention). Min-width 1280px on the grid container.
